Comandante is one of the best-known names in hand grinders, and their Nitro Blade burrs are made from nitrogen-hardened steel that holds an edge for a long time. The C60 is a premium grinder built to last for years.

This is a splurge, but it's one of the grinders a lot of coffee people end up with. Read more in [my hand grinder post](/coffee/reviews/hand-coffee-grinders).
